  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lagos Eko Secondary Education Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of the project is to improve the quality of public junior and senior secondary education in Lagos State. The project will support over half a million public school students in 637 secondary schools, over 7,000 teachers and school administrators and will strengthen the capacity of district, state and education institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
